            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe document is created from a public sample PDF and sent **silently** to the connected PandaDoc member's own email (read by Make API Call from /public/v1/members/current): a sandbox API key may only send to emails of the sender's own domain. Wait Until Ready makes Create Document continue about a minute after the document was created (PandaDoc creates documents asynchronously). The document is deleted at the end."
